  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Construction of Qukes-Qafe Plloce (Choocus-Chalf Ploch) Section of Tirana-Korca Road Corridor Project - Additional Financing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to provide the shortest earthquake resilient all-weather road link with the southern isolated villages, borders of North Macedonia and Greece and the rest of Europe within the inner Balkans by reducing travel time, vehicle operating cost and increase comfort, safety and reliability; meet the current and future transport demands; and  help accelerate socioeconomic activities by improving access of people to social amenities, businesses and employment opportunities, trade, tourism resulting from enhanced internal and regional interconnectivity.</narrative>
  </description>
